{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"check"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"against"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"committed"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TrackingPlan"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"File"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanCheckO","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TrackingPlanCheck"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The committed plan’s files, by their paths in its directory.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"committed"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The check, whose "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck\/description"},{"type":"text","text":" is its report."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The files are compared by what they mean, not by their bytes: each event the committed index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lists is matched with this plan’s event of the same name and version, and their properties,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optionality, default values